      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-11-21T17:47:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would expect them to run concurrently unless configured with dependencies -- in other words, our current behavior for jobs.  Reasoning: because reporter jobs could be used for sending chat messages, etc, which don\u0027t have an inherent sequencing, so therefore sequencing should be optional.",
      "parentUuid": "11ba52dc_2b266cc4",
      "revId": "87005477635d5eb16f258edbde164e9010b1062e",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543"
