      "writtenOn": "2025-11-21T01:23:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Would the update-superproject job need the subproject git repo state in it in order to know what to update the superproject to? Or are we expecting that to be performed via some lookup in the job (say against the code review system API?). I\u0027m wondering if we\u0027re going to potentially encourage people to over limit the job state to exclude information that they probably need.",
