      "writtenOn": "2025-11-22T18:28:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see now that the spec notes new information will be supplied in zuul vars to the reporter job including the new merge hashes from the code review system. I think that was the critical piece of info that was missing before. But yes good point that the old git state is speculative and while it reflects what we expect to end up in the final post merge state critical details like hash values will differ.",
