      "writtenOn": "2025-11-21T01:23:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wonder if semaphores could be given some sort of queue line jumping for these jobs to mitigate most of these concerns. Probably not necessary to solve that problem in the initial implementation as long as we\u0027re happy with the known limitation.",
      "revId": "87005477635d5eb16f258edbde164e9010b1062e",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543"
