        "id": 1
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-11-21T17:47:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s a good idea.  I also like deferring it for now since I think the limitation is okay.\n\nI talked with Albin a while ago about a new type of zuul trigger that fires when a queue item is reported on another pipeline (to effectively set up pipeline chaining).  I think that if we did that, that would also solve this problem, because I would not expect that trigger to fire until after the reporting jobs finished.",
